{"speciesId":239,"names":{"fr":"Élekid","es":"Elekid","en":"Elekid","ja":"エレキッド"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"It rotates its arms to generate electricity, but it tires easily, so it charges up only a little bit."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"Even in the most vicious storm, this POKéMON plays happily if thunder rumbles in the sky."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"It loves violent thunder. The space between its horns flickers bluish- white when it is charging energy."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"ELEKID stores electricity in its body. If it touches metal and accidentally discharges all its built-up electricity, this POKéMON begins swinging its arms in circles to recharge itself."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"ELEKID stores electricity in its body. If it touches metal and accidentally discharges all its built-up electricity, this POKéMON begins swinging its arms in circles to recharge itself."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"If it touches metal and discharges the electricity it has stored in its body, an ELEKID begins swinging its arms in circles to recharge itself."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"Even in the most vicious storm, this POKéMON plays happily if thunder rumbles in the sky."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It rotates its arms to generate electricity, but it tires easily, so it charges up only a little bit."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It generates electricity by whirling its arms. However, it can’t store the energy it makes."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It generates electricity by whirling its arms. However, it can’t store the energy it makes."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"A weak electric current flows between its horns. Sticking a hand there shocks the unwary."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It rotates its arms to generate electricity, but it tires easily, so it only charges up a little bit."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Even in the most vicious storm, this Pokémon plays happily if thunder rumbles in the sky."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Un faible courant électrique circule entre ses cornes. Attention à ne pas y mettre la main!"},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"A weak electric current flows between its horns. Sticking a hand there shocks the unwary."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Un faible courant électrique circule entre ses cornes. Attention à ne pas y mettre la main!"},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"A weak electric current flows between its horns. Sticking a hand there shocks the unwary."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Spinning its arms around to generate electricity makes the area between its horns shine light blue."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Spinning its arms around to generate electricity makes the area between its horns shine light blue."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il génère de l’électricité en battant des bras, mais il n’a aucun moyen de stocker cette énergie."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Genera electricidad girando los brazos. No obstante, es incapaz de almacenar la energía creada."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It generates electricity by whirling its arms. However, it can’t store the energy it makes."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"両腕を ぐるぐる 振り回して 電気を 発生させる。しかし 作った 電気は ためておけない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Ses cornes s’illuminent lorsqu’il fait tourner ses bras pour générer de l’électricité."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Al girar ambos brazos para generar electricidad, sus cuernos se iluminan con una luz blanquecina."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Spinning its arms around to generate electricity makes the area between its horns shine light blue."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"両腕を ぐるぐる まわして 電気を 発生させると ツノのあいだが 青白く 光る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Élekid stocke de l’électricité dans son corps. S’il touche du métal et décharge sans le faire exprès son électricité, ce Pokémon fait des cercles avec ses bras pour se recharger."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Elekid acumula electricidad. Si entra en contacto con algo de metal y descarga accidentalmente toda la electricidad almacenada, empieza a agitar los brazos en círculo para volver a cargarse."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Elekid stores electricity in its body. If it touches metal and accidentally discharges all its built-up electricity, this Pokémon begins swinging its arms in circles to recharge itself."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"金属に 触って 体に ためた 電気が 放電 してしまうと 両腕を ぐるぐる 回して 再び 電気を ためる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Élekid stocke de l’électricité dans son corps. S’il touche du métal et décharge sans le faire exprès son électricité, ce Pokémon fait des cercles avec ses bras pour se recharger."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Elekid acumula electricidad. Si entra en contacto con algo de metal y descarga accidentalmente toda la electricidad almacenada, empieza a agitar los brazos en círculo para volver a cargarse."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Elekid stores electricity in its body. If it touches metal and accidentally discharges all its built-up electricity, this Pokémon begins swinging its arms in circles to recharge itself."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"金属に 触って 体に ためた 電気が 放電 してしまうと 両腕を ぐるぐる 回して 再び 電気を ためる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Ce Pokémon « tète » les prises électriques des maisons comme s’il s’agissait de biberons de lait, et ce jusqu’au dernier ampère."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Cuando está en una casa, usa los enchufes de la pared a modo de biberones. Le encanta chupar electricidad."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"When it’s in a house, electrical outlets serve as its baby bottles. It sucks down electricity."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"家に いるときは コンセントが ほ乳びん 代わり。 電気を ちゅうちゅう 吸ってるよ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Togedemaru et lui se disputent les mêmes sources d’électricité. Leurs combats se terminent souvent par une égalité."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Los Togedemaru siempre intentan robarles la electricidad, lo que suele terminar en combates muy reñidos."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"This Pokémon is constantly fighting with Togedemaru that try to steal its electricity. It’s a pretty even match."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"電気を 奪いにきた トゲデマルと しょっちゅう ケンカ。 結果は 大体 互角と いった ところ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il adore le bruit de la foudre. Si vous l’enregistrez, vous pouvez le lui diffuser à loisir pour le mettre de bonne humeur."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"El ruido de los truenos le mejora el ánimo. Conviene tener a mano una grabación para cuando esté en horas bajas."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"When it hears the crash of thunder, Elekid’s mood improves. It can be useful to record that sound and play it when Elekid’s feeling down."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"雷の 落ちる 音を 聞くと ご機嫌。 落ち込んだときの ために 録音 しておくと 便利だよ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Lorsqu’il est chargé à bloc, ses cornes émettent une lueur bleuâtre. Attention à ne pas les toucher ou vous risquez l’électrocution !"},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Cuando se carga de electricidad, sus cuernos emiten una luz blanquecina. Quien lo toque recibirá un potente calambrazo."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"When its horns shine a bluish white, that’s the sign it’s fully charged. You’ll get a shocking jolt if you touch it!"},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"ツノが 青白く 光ったときが 充電 完了の サイン。 触ると ビリリと 痺れるぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il ne tient plus en place quand un orage approche. Lorsqu’il entend le tonnerre gronder, il devient tout excité."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Cuando se acerca una tormenta, pierde la compostura. Si oye el sonido de un trueno, no se puede contener y monta un revuelo."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"When a storm approaches, this Pokémon gets restless. Once Elekid hears the sound of thunder, it gets full-on rowdy."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"嵐が 近づくと 落ち着きが なくなる。 雷の 音が 聞こえると たまらず 騒ぎだす。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il a encore du mal à emmagasiner l’électricité. Pour s’en nourrir, il se faufile dans les maisons à la recherche de prises électriques."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"No se le da bien acumular electricidad, por lo que se cuela en las casas en busca de enchufes para alimentarse."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"It’s not good at storing electricity yet. This Pokémon sneaks into people’s homes, looking for electrical outlets to eat electricity from."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"まだ 電気を 溜めるのが 下手。 電気を 食べるために 民家に 忍びこみ コンセントを 探す。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"They generate electricity by spinning their arms. During a thunderstorm, if one hears the lively voices of children out in the wilderness, what one is actually hearing are the voices of Elekid."}],"varieties":[{"id":239,"moves":[{"name":"karate-chop","learns":[[3,"egg",0],[4,"egg",0],[5,"egg",0],[6,"egg",0],[7,"egg",0],[8,"egg",0],[9,"egg",0],[10,"egg",0],[11,"egg",0],[14,"egg",0],[15,"egg",0],[16,"egg",0],[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0]]},{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"fire-punch","learns":[[3,"machine",0],[4,"machine",0],[5,"egg",0],[6,"egg",0],[6,"tutor",0],[7,"egg",0],[8,"egg",0],[9,"egg",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"egg",0],[10,"tutor",0],[11,"egg",0],[14,"egg",0],[14,"tutor",0],[15,"egg",0],[16,"egg",0],[16,"tutor",0